Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 10:18:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 274/307] !R (3DEngine) Reduce terrain integration comments.

---
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/3dEngine.cpp       |  73 ++--
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/3dEngine.h         |  57 ++-
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/3dEngineLoad.cpp   |   2 +-
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/Brush.cpp          |  14 +-
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/Brush.h            |  16 +-
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/RoadRenderNode.cpp |  50 +--
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/cvars.cpp          | 124 +++----
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/terrain.cpp        |  13 +-
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/terrain.h          |   5 +-
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/terrain_node.cpp   |  28 +-
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/terrain_sector.h   |  19 +-
 .../Cry3DEngine/terrain_sector_render.cpp     | 336 ++++++------------
 Code/CryEngine/Cry3DEngine/terran_edit.cpp    |   6 +-
