-		// the terrain base pass, with terrain shading. Drawing it a second time here is what z-fights at
-		// distance, so it is skipped - in camera passes only. Shadow and recursive passes never reach
-		// this test and keep the object exactly as it was; so do SVOGI, HeightMap AO, physics, the
-		// heightmap and Sandbox selection, none of which run through CBrush::Render.
+		// The terrain draws all of this brush's triangles itself this frame; a second draw z-fights at
